From: Week 6 lab workaround
Subject: [PATCH] bootloader: recognize XMC MFID 0x70 for XM25QH128AHIG

The ESP32-S3 reports flash ID 0x207018 (vendor 0x20, MFID 0x70,
CPID 0x18). The bundled HAL's strict XMC check accepts MFID 0x41
for CPID 0x17..0x20 but omits 0x70, causing hw_init to reboot before
Zephyr starts. Include 0x70 in that same CPID range.

This patch changes the external Zephyr module at:
modules/hal/espressif/zephyr/port/bootloader/bootloader_flash.c

It is kept here so the local toolchain workaround is documented and repeatable.

--- a/zephyr/port/bootloader/bootloader_flash.c
+++ b/zephyr/port/bootloader/bootloader_flash.c
@@ -707 +707 @@
-    } else if (mfid == 0x41) {
+    } else if (mfid == 0x41 || mfid == 0x70) {
        if (cpid >= 0x17 && cpid <= 0x20) {
            matched = true;
        }
